{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-217812","model_call":2,"request":{"op":"document","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#7_1744989077"},"record":{"query":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#7_1744989077","op":"document"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#7_1744989077","document":"Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020 ... Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020 Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020 What is canthus? Where is Medial Canthus? Where is Lateral Canthus? What are the different types of Canthal Tilts: What is Positive Canthal Tilt? Importance of Positive Canthal Tilt What is Negative Canthal Tilt? Cause of Negative Canthal Tilt What is Neutral Canthal Tilt? Can you change Canthal tilt? How to improve your Canthal Tilt? What are the different methods for Canthal Tilt Correction? What is Canthoplasty? Was this post helpful?  ... Can you change Canthal tilt? A canthoplasty is a technique used to change Canthal tilt. By canthoplasty your canthal tilt is fixed by making lateral canthus above the medical according to need normally about 2 mm above but varies with demand by the person. As a result the Lateral canthus becomes higher the medical canthus i.e positive canthal tilt. Rarely people looks for negative or neutral canthal tilt. Canthoplasty is a type of optic surgery in which surgeon opens the eyelids and tighten and harden muscle tendons. How to improve your Canthal Tilt? If we want to improve canthal tilt we must know the cause of the canthal tilt changing i.e why the canthal tilt changes over a time period? There are many causes why canthal Tilt changes like aging are one of the most common causes. One must take a lot of effort to improve the canthal tilt.","ok":true,"op":"document"},"time":14},"model_calls":2,"document_judgments":1,"relevance_3":0,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
