{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-217812","model_call":13,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"upturned eyes\" \"upward slanting eyes\" \"almond eyes\") (+ genetics genetic hereditary anatomy ethnic ethnicity))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"upturned eyes\" \"upward slanting eyes\" \"almond eyes\") (+ genetics genetic hereditary anatomy ethnic ethnicity))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_50_2758809857#6_3962157977","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2537","rank":1,"snippet":"Kim, FRACS (Plast), MS (Plast), MBBS (Hons) Specialist Plastic Surgeon ( 102) Book a consultation CONTACT NOW July 16, 2018 Answer: Eye shape It is possible to change the shape of the eyes (commonly done in Asian eyelids) but suitability need to be carefully assessed. Wish you the best in your journey, Dr Leo Kim, Specialist Plastic Surgeon in Sydney Helpful Leo Kim, FRACS (Plast), MS (Plast), MBBS (Hons) Specialist Plastic Surgeon ( 102) Book a consultation CONTACT NOW December 10, 2017 Answer: Change shape of eye to almond eye Eye shape depends on multiple factors including eyelid and orbit <cover>anatomy. Almond eyes </cover>are beautifully inherited but they can also be achieved through special surgery. Consultation is necessary. https://tabanmd.com/almond-eye-surgery/ 1 person found this helpful Mehryar (Ray) Taban, MD, FACS Oculoplastic Surgeon, Board Certified in Ophthalmology ( 241) Book a virtual consultation CONTACT NOW December 10, 2017 Answer: Change shape of eye to almond eye Eye shape depends on multiple factors including eyelid and orbit anatomy. Almond eyes are beautifully inherited but they can also be achieved through special surgery.\" , \"start_char\": 3503.000000 , \"title\": \"Can I "},"time":334},"model_calls":13,"document_judgments":8,"relevance_3":0,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
