{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-217812","model_call":15,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ lateral canthus) (+ medial canthus) (+ higher above elevated))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"positive canthal tilt\" (+ lateral canthus) (+ medial canthus) (+ higher above elevated))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#2_1744980928","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2539","rank":1,"snippet":"helpful? \" , \"segment\": \"Also Read: How to tell Low Cheekbones or High Cheekbones What are the different types of Canthal Tilts: There are three types of tilts i.e Positive Canthal Tilt Negative Canthal Tilt Neutral Canthal Tilt What is Positive Canthal Tilt? A Positive Canthal Tilt can be said whenever there is an angle between medial and lateral canthus is five to eight degrees. It can easily be measured by drawing an imaginary line between the mid pupil portion of the eye. Importance of <cover>Positive Canthal Tilt The Canthus on the ear side i.e lateral canthus should be 5 to 8 degrees higher </cover>than that of medial i.e canthus towards the nose. Because beautician believes it is a factor of beauty. So Positive canthal tilt eyes are called as Hunter Eyes. It has been widely measured and discussed in the fashion industry. It has a role in fashion industries as well as gender and ethnicity.\" , \"start_char\": 1128.000000 , \"title\": \"Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020\" , \"url\": \"https://communitypharmacies.co.uk/"},"time":207},"model_calls":15,"document_judgments":10,"relevance_3":0,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
