{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-217812","model_call":29,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ cause causes factors determinants determined) (+ tendon ligament bone orbital eyelid))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ cause causes factors determinants determined) (+ tendon ligament bone orbital eyelid))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_14_846829933#4_1744984227","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2552","rank":1,"snippet":"your Canthal Tilt? What are the different methods for Canthal Tilt Correction? What is Canthoplasty? Was this post helpful? \" , \"segment\": \"It is found in young people and the fashion industry believes that it makes the look more and more attractive especially young models. What is Negative Canthal Tilt? It is most commonly found in old age peoples and during ageing. As it can be considered as a sign of ageing in both women and men. As negative canthal tilt is common in old. So Negative Canthal tilt Lookism has less value in the field of beauty and fashion. Cause of Negative Canthal Tilt It can be explained as excessive upper and lower skin of the <cover>eyelid causes negative canthal tilt. </cover>It is sometimes considered as the appearance of a strongly tried or sorrowful face. What is Neutral Canthal Tilt? The Neutral Canthal Tilt means there is no angle between Medial and Lateral canthus.\" , \"start_char\": 1998.000000 , \"title\": \"Canthal Tilt |Positive and Negative Tilt Ultimate Guide 2020\" , \"url\": \"https://communitypharmacies.co.uk/canthal-tilt/\" }"},"time":105},"model_calls":29,"document_judgments":20,"relevance_3":0,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
