{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-217812","model_call":33,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ \"what causes\" causes determinants factors) (+ aging genetics ethnicity anatomy))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"canthal tilt\" (+ \"what causes\" causes determinants factors) (+ aging genetics ethnicity anatomy))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1370231623#3_2504752287","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2555","rank":1,"snippet":": \"Canthal Tilt in Cosmetic Plastic Surgery Canthal Tilt in Cosmetic Plastic Surgery Types of Canthal Tilt How to Improve your Canthal Tilt Canthal Tilt Correction Canthoplasty Positive Canthal Tilt Neutral Canthal Tilt \" , \"segment\": \"Neutral canthal til also contributes to the tired look that so many women dislke. Negative canthal tilt is most commonly an advanced sign of aging in both men and women. It is commonly associated with excess upper and lower eyelid skin. It is a strong driver of a tired or sorrowful appearance. How to Improve your <cover>Canthal Tilt So what causes canthal til to change over time? Like aging </cover>itself, diminishing canthal tilt is multifactorial. But, there are a number of things that you can do to maintain your overall periorbatl appearance. Canthal Tilt Correction 1. Do not smoke. Smoking causes reduced elasticity in every tissue of your body including your lower eyelids.\" , \"start_char\": 1426.000000 , \"title\": \"Canthal Tilt | Cosmetic Surgery | Fort Lauderdale to Vero Beach, FL.\" , \"url\": \"https://www.oceandriveplasticsurgery.com/canthal-tilt-in-cosmetic-plastic-surgery/\" }"},"time":57},"model_calls":33,"document_judgments":24,"relevance_3":0,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
