{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-217812","model_call":48,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"lateral canthus\" \"medial canthus\" (+ higher lower) (+ ethnic sex women men anthropometric normal))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"lateral canthus\" \"medial canthus\" (+ higher lower) (+ ethnic sex women men anthropometric normal))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1397690825#6_3080890346","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2565","rank":1,"snippet":", \"end_char\": 3310.000000 , \"headings\": \"How to Get Attractive Eyes for Guys How to Get Attractive Eyes for Guys Orbital Height/Width Upper Eyelid Exposure Canthal Tilt Downturned Medial Canthus Arch Shape Eyebrows Scleral Show Color Limbal Ring Overall Dimensions Unattractive Male Eyes Attractive Male Eyes How To Get Nice Eyes Mewing Blepharoplasty (Eyelid Lift) Canthoplasty & Canthopexy Eyebrows \" , \"segment\": \"But if your lateral canthus is lower than your medial canthus, you have negative canthal tilt. The <cover>normal male Caucasian medial canthus is about 2 mm lower than the lateral canthus (</cover>positive canthal tilt). Women have an even more positive canthal tilt, and their medial canthus is 4 mm lower than the lateral canthus. A positive canthal tilt is also known as a Mongoloid feature. Indeed, far eastern ethnic groups have a more positive tilt. Generally, a slightly positive canthal tilt is most attractive. A negative canthal tilt is unattractive and makes you look tired. A canthal tilt that’s too positive makes you look like an alien. Before you conclude that you have a negative canthal tilt, keep in mind that taking a ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1397690825#6_3080890346","rank":1,"relevance":2}]},"time":104},"model_calls":48,"document_judgments":38,"relevance_3":3,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
{"actor":"server","event":"request","topic_id":"2024-217812","model_call":48,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2565"},"model_calls":48,"document_judgments":38,"relevance_3":3,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-217812","model_call":48,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2565"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q2565"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1397690825#5_3080888894","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2565","rank":2,"snippet":"Mewing Blepharoplasty (Eyelid Lift) Canthoplasty & Canthopexy Eyebrows \" , \"segment\": \"Canthal Tilt The canthus is the pink part of your eye. The medial canthus is by your nose, and the lateral canthus is on the outside of your face. Canthal tilt is the angle between your medial and lateral canthus. If your lateral canthus is higher than your medial canthus, you have a positive canthal tilt. You have a neutral tilt when the canthi are aligned. But if your lateral canthus is lower than your medial canthus, you have negative canthal tilt. The <cover>normal male Caucasian medial canthus is about 2 mm lower than the lateral canthus (</cover>positive canthal tilt). Women have an even more positive canthal tilt, and their medial canthus is 4 mm lower than the lateral canthus. A positive canthal tilt is also known as a Mongoloid feature. Indeed, far eastern ethnic groups have a more positive tilt.\" , \"start_char\": 2097.000000 , \"title\": \"How to Get Attractive Eyes for Guys – Magnum Workshop\" , \"url\": \"https://magnumworkshop.com/how-to-get-attractive-eyes-for-guys/\" }","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_1397690825#5_3080888894","rank":2,"relevance":2}]},"time":6},"model_calls":48,"document_judgments":38,"relevance_3":3,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
